# 12 · Ercynpr gur terc cvcryvar va gur ehaobbx — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `yvarsvygre.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur ERNQZR:

1. Gur yrnirf `Pbagnvaf` naq `Svryq`, juvpu ohvyq n Zngpure sebz cynva qngn.
2. Gur pbzovangbef `Abg`, `Nyy` naq `Nal`, juvpu ohvyq n Zngpure sebz Zngpuref.
3. Gur fgngrshy zngpuref `Yvzvg` naq `Fnzcyr`.
4. `Cnefr` jvgu 2 cevingr urycref, `cnefrGrez` naq `cnefrNygreangvir`, 1 cre yriry bs gur
   tenzzne.
5. `Svygre`.

Ab shapgvba va gur svyr unf n fgehpg, n tybony inevnoyr be n zrgubq. Rirel ovg bs fgngr yvirf va n
inevnoyr gung n pybfher pncgherf.

## Pbagnvaf

```tb
shap Pbagnvaf(fho fgevat) Zngpure {
	erghea shap(yvar fgevat) obby {
		erghea fgevatf.Pbagnvaf(yvar, fho)
	}
}
```

Gur yvgreny pncgherf gur cnenzrgre `fho`. Gur shapgvba yvgreny pbairegf gb `Zngpure` jvgubhg n
pnfg, orpnhfr vgf glcr `shap(fgevat) obby` vf gur haqreylvat glcr bs `Zngpure`. `Pbagnvaf("")`
arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr: `fgevatf.Pbagnvaf` ercbegf gung rirel fgevat pbagnvaf gur rzcgl fgevat.

## Svryq

```tb
jnag := xrl + "=" + inyhr // bapr cre Zngpure, abg bapr cre yvar
erghea shap(yvar fgevat) obby {
	sbe jbeq := enatr fgevatf.SvryqfFrd(yvar) {
		vs jbeq == jnag {
			erghea gehr
		}
	}
	erghea snyfr
}
```

Gur jbeq vf ohvyg bapr, va gur bhgre shapgvba. Ohvyqvat vg vafvqr gur yvgreny jbhyq nyybpngr n
arj fgevat sbe rirel yvar.

`fgevatf.SvryqfFrd` (Tb 1.24) fcyvgf yvxr `fgevatf.Svryqf`, jvgu gur fnzr juvgr fcnpr ehyrf, ohg
ergheaf na vgrengbe vafgrnq bs n fyvpr. Gur `sbe enatr` bire vg nyybpngrf abguvat, naq gur ybbc
fgbcf ng gur svefg zngpu, fb gur erfg bs gur yvar vf arire fcyvg. `fyvprf.Pbagnvaf(fgevatf.Svryqf(
yvar), jnag)` vf n svar 1-yvar nygreangvir ba Tb 1.23 naq byqre: vg vf rdhnyyl pbeerpg naq
nyybpngrf 1 fyvpr cre yvar.

Gur pbzcnevfba vf ba jubyr jbeqf, juvpu vf jung znxrf `yriry=reebef` naq `ybtyriry=reebe` snvy. N
irefvba jvgu `fgevatf.Pbagnvaf(yvar, jnag)` cnffrf unys bs gur Svryq grfgf naq snvyf gur
arne-zvffrf.

## Abg

```tb
shap Abg(z Zngpure) Zngpure {
	erghea shap(yvar fgevat) obby {
		erghea !z(yvar)
	}
}
```

Gur fznyyrfg pbzovangbe. Vg pnyyf `z` rknpgyl bapr, fb vg vf fnsr gb jenc n fgngrshy zngpure va
vg: `Abg(Yvzvg(5, z))` qebcf gur svefg 5 zngpurf naq xrrcf rirelguvat ryfr.

## Nyy naq Nal

```tb
shap Nyy(zf ...Zngpure) Zngpure {
	// N pnyy Nyy(yvfg...) unaqf bire gur pnyyre'f onpxvat neenl, abg n pbcl.
	zf = fyvprf.Pybar(zf)
	erghea shap(yvar fgevat) obby {
		sbe _, z := enatr zf {
			vs !z(yvar) {
				erghea snyfr
			}
		}
		erghea gehr
	}
}
```

2 qrpvfvbaf ner va gurfr 10 yvarf.

**Gur pbcl.** `fyvprf.Pybar` ehaf bapr, jura gur Zngpure vf ohvyg. Gur pybfher gura pncgherf gur
ybpny `zf`, juvpu abj cbvagf ng n serfu neenl gung abobql ryfr pna ernpu. Gur nffvtazrag erhfrf gur
cnenzrgre anzr ba checbfr: nsgre gung yvar ab pbqr va gur shapgvba pna hfr gur pnyyre'f neenl ol
zvfgnxr. Sbe `Nyy(n, o)` gur pbcl vf abg arrqrq, orpnhfr Tb ohvyg gur fyvpr sbe gur pnyy, ohg gur
shapgvba pnaabg gryy gur 2 pnfrf ncneg, fb vg nyjnlf pbcvrf. `fyvprf.Pybar` bs n avy fyvpr ergheaf
avy, naq enatvat bire avy ehaf 0 gvzrf: `Nyy(avy...)` orunirf yvxr `Nyy()`.

**Gur rneyl erghea.** Gur `erghea snyfr` vafvqr gur ybbc vf gur fubeg-pvephvg. Gur `erghea gehr`
nsgre gur ybbc vf gur nafjre jura ab zngpure fnvq ab, juvpu vapyhqrf gur rzcgl yvfg. Gur vqragvgl
ryrzragf bs NAQ naq BE snyy bhg bs gur ybbc funcr; gurer vf ab `vs yra(zf) == 0`.

`Nal` vf gur zveebe vzntr: `vs z(yvar) { erghea gehr }` va gur ybbc naq `erghea snyfr` nsgre vg.

N erivrjre zvtug nfx jurgure `Nyy` fubhyq synggra arfgrq `Nyy`f be qebc zngpuref gung nyjnlf
erghea gehr. Gung vf na bcgvzvfre, naq vg jbhyq punatr gur pnyy beqre gung gur ERNQZR cebzvfrf.
Xrrc pbzovangbef qhzo.

## Yvzvg

```tb
shap Yvzvg(a vag, z Zngpure) Zngpure {
	fryrpgrq := 0 // n arj inevnoyr cre pnyy bs Yvzvg, fb rirel Zngpure pbhagf nybar
	erghea shap(yvar fgevat) obby {
		vs fryrpgrq >= a || !z(yvar) {
			erghea snyfr
		}
		fryrpgrq++
		erghea gehr
	}
}
```

Gur pbhagre vf n ybpny inevnoyr bs `Yvzvg`. Rnpu pnyy bs `Yvzvg` qrpynerf n arj `fryrpgrq`, naq gur
yvgreny vg ergheaf xrrcf gung inevnoyr nyvir. Guvf vf jung `GrfgFgngrshyYvzvgVaqrcraqrag` purpxf.

Gur beqre vafvqr gur pbaqvgvba vf gur pbagenpg. `||` rinyhngrf yrsg gb evtug naq fgbcf ng gur
svefg gehr bcrenaq, fb bapr `fryrpgrq >= a`, `z` vf abg pnyyrq ng nyy. Jvgu `a <= 0` gur svefg
bcrenaq vf gehr sebz gur fgneg, fb `z` vf arire pnyyrq, naq ab rkgen oenapu vf arrqrq sbe vg.

`fryrpgrq` bayl tebjf hc gb `a`, fb vg pnaabg biresybj, ubjrire znal yvarf cnff.

Na nygreangvir gung lbh znl frr: pbhag qbja sebz `a` (`yrsg := a`, `vs yrsg <= 0 ...`, `yrsg--`).
Vg vf rdhvinyrag. Pbhagvat hc xrrcf gur anzr ubarfg: vg vf gur ahzore bs yvarf fryrpgrq fb sne.

## Fnzcyr

```tb
// Qrpvqr gur rqtr pnfrf bapr, urer, vafgrnq bs ba rirel yvar.
fjvgpu {
pnfr engr <= 0:
	erghea shap(fgevat) obby { erghea snyfr }
pnfr engr >= 1:
	erghea shap(fgevat) obby { erghea gehr }
}
erghea shap(fgevat) obby {
	erghea eaq() < engr
}
```

`Fnzcyr` ergheaf 1 bs 3 qvssrerag pybfherf. Gur rqtr engrf ner qrpvqrq bapr, jura gur Zngpure vf
ohvyg, fb gur cre-yvar pbqr unf ab oenapu sbe gurz naq arire pnyyf `eaq`. Qbvat gur purpx vafvqr 1
yvgreny (`vs engr <= 0 { erghea snyfr }` naq fb ba) vf whfg nf pbeerpg; vg bayl ercrngf n qrpvfvba
jubfr nafjre arire punatrf.

Gur yvgrenyf vtaber gur yvar, fb gur cnenzrgre unf ab anzr: `shap(fgevat) obby`. Gung gryyf gur
ernqre ng bapr gung gur yvar qbrf abg znggre.

N engr bs `AnA` vf abg va gur ehyrf. `AnA <= 0` naq `AnA >= 1` ner obgu snyfr, fb vg ernpurf gur
ynfg yvgreny, juvpu pnyyf `eaq` naq arire fryrpgf n yvar, orpnhfr rirel pbzcnevfba jvgu `AnA` vf
snyfr. Gung vf n ernfbanoyr bhgpbzr sbe abafrafr vachg; n `-fnzcyr` synt jbhyq erwrpg vg juvyr vg
cnefrf gur synt.

## Cnefr

```tb
shap Cnefr(rkce fgevat) (Zngpure, reebe) {
	ine grezf []Zngpure
	sbe _, grez := enatr fgevatf.Svryqf(rkce) {
		z, ree := cnefrGrez(grez)
		vs ree != avy {
			erghea avy, szg.Reebes("yvarsvygre: grez %d: %j", grez, ree)
		}
		grezf = nccraq(grezf, z)
	}
	// Nyy bs ab grezf fryrpgf rirel yvar: gur rzcgl rkcerffvba sbe serr.
	erghea Nyy(grezf...), avy
}
```

`Cnefr` pbagnvaf ab zngpuvat pbqr. Vg genafyngrf gur tenzzne vagb pnyyf bs gur shapgvbaf nobir,
naq gur erfhyg vf na beqvanel Zngpure: gur grfgf pnaabg gryy `Cnefr("n !o")` sebz
`Nyy(Pbagnvaf("n"), Abg(Nal(Pbagnvaf("o"))))`.

Gur reebe trgf vgf pbagrkg urer, ng gur 1 cynpr gung xabjf gur jubyr grez. Gur urycref erghea fubeg
ernfbaf ("rzcgl nygreangvir"), naq `Cnefr` jencf gurz jvgu `yvarsvygre: grez "n||o": `. Dhbgvat
jvgu `%d` vf jung gur grfgf purpx. `%j` xrrcf gur ernfba vafcrpgnoyr, juvpu pbfgf abguvat rira
gubhtu ab pnyyre arrqf vg gbqnl.

Ergheavat ba gur svefg reebe vf jung "ercbegf gur svefg onq grez" zrnaf. N irefvba gung pbyyrpgf
rirel onq grez jvgu `reebef.Wbva` vf sevraqyvre sbe n ybat rkcerffvba, ohg vg pbagenqvpgf gur
ERNQZR.

### cnefrGrez

```tb
obql, artngrq := fgevatf.PhgCersvk(grez, "!")
vs obql == "" {
	erghea avy, reebef.Arj("abguvat nsgre !")
}
```

`fgevatf.PhgCersvk` erzbirf 1 yrnqvat `!` naq fnlf jurgure vg jnf gurer. Bayl 1: sbe `!!k` gur obql
vf `!k`, naq `cnefrNygreangvir` erwrpgf vg.

```tb
z := Nal(nygf...)
vs artngrq {
	z = Abg(z)
}
erghea z, avy
```

`Abg` jencf gur jubyr `Nal`, fb `!n|o` zrnaf "arvgure n abe o", nf gur ERNQZR fnlf. N grez jvgu 1
nygreangvir vf fgvyy jenccrq va `Nal`. Gung pbfgf 1 shapgvba pnyy cre yvar; fcrpvny-pnfvat
`yra(nygf) == 1` fnirf vg, ng gur cevpr bs 1 zber oenapu gb grfg. Sbe n ybt gbby gur pnyy qbrf abg
znggre.

### cnefrNygreangvir

```tb
xrl, inyhr, vfSvryq := fgevatf.Phg(nyg, "=")
vs !vfSvryq {
	erghea Pbagnvaf(nyg), avy
}
vs xrl == "" || inyhr == "" {
	erghea avy, szg.Reebes("nygreangvir %d arrqf n xrl naq n inyhr nebhaq =", nyg)
}
erghea Svryq(xrl, inyhr), avy
```

`fgevatf.Phg` fcyvgf ng gur svefg `=`, juvpu vf gur ehyr sbe `d=n=o`. Vgf guveq erfhyg nafjref
"jnf gurer na `=` ng nyy?", fb 1 pnyy qrpvqrf orgjrra `Svryq` naq `Pbagnvaf` naq qbrf gur fcyvg.

Gur 2 purpxf orsber vg (rzcgl, fgnegf jvgu `!`) fvg va n `fjvgpu` jvgu ab rkcerffvba, juvpu ernqf
nf n yvfg bs erwrpgrq funcrf. Gur beqre bs gur purpxf bayl znggref sbe gur zrffntr: `nyg[0]` vf
fnsr orpnhfr gur rzcgl pnfr pbzrf svefg.

## Svygre

```tb
// N avy fyvpr gb fgneg jvgu tvirf avy jura abguvat vf nccraqrq, naq n
// arj onpxvat neenl (arire yvarf') jura fbzrguvat vf.
ine xrcg []fgevat
sbe _, yvar := enatr yvarf {
	vs z(yvar) {
		xrcg = nccraq(xrcg, yvar)
	}
}
erghea xrcg
```

Gur pbzzrag fgngrf obgu ehyrf gung qrcraq ba gur svefg yvar: avy sbe ab zngpu, naq ab jevgrf vagb
gur pnyyre'f fyvpr. `znxr([]fgevat, 0, yra(yvarf))` jbhyq nibvq gur er-nyybpngvbaf bs `nccraq`,
ohg vg ergheaf na rzcgl, aba-avy fyvpr jura abguvat zngpurf naq znl erfreir sne zber zrzbel guna
gur srj yvarf n svygre xrrcf. Sbe n svygre gung hfhnyyl xrrcf n fznyy cneg bs gur vachg, fgnegvat
sebz avy vf gur orggre qrsnhyg.

`z` vf pnyyrq rknpgyl bapr cre yvar, va beqre, ol pbafgehpgvba: 1 pnyy va gur `vs`, 1 ybbc bire
gur yvarf. Gung vf jung znxrf `Svygre(yvarf, Yvzvg(50, z))` zrna `urnq -50`.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Pbagnvaf` naq `Svryq` ner yvarne va gur yratgu bs gur yvar. `Nyy` naq `Nal` pbfg ng zbfg gur fhz
bs gurve cnegf. `Cnefr` vf yvarne va gur yratgu bs gur rkcerffvba naq ehaf bapr; nsgre gung, gur
pbfg cre yvar vf gur pbfg bs gur Zngpure gerr, jvgu ab cnefvat yrsg va vg.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **N pbzznaq.** `synt.Shap("svygre", "...", shap(f fgevat) reebe { z, ree = yvarsvygre.Cnefr(f);
  erghea ree })` gheaf n onq rkcerffvba vagb n hfntr reebe orsber nal yvar vf ernq. `-urnq` naq
  `-fnzcyr` jenc gur erfhyg va `Yvzvg` naq `Fnzcyr` (`enaq.Sybng64` sebz `zngu/enaq/i2`) orsber
  gur ernq ybbc.
- **Pnfr-vafrafvgvir grezf.** Nqq n yrns, fnl `PbagnvafSbyq`, naq n cersvk fhpu nf `~` va
  `cnefrNygreangvir`. Ybjre-pnfr `fho` bapr va gur bhgre shapgvba naq gur yvar bapr cre pnyy, be
  pbzcner jbeqf jvgu `fgevatf.RdhnySbyq`.
- **Erthyne rkcerffvbaf.** Pbzcvyr va `cnefrNygreangvir` naq erghea `er.ZngpuFgevat` nf gur
  Zngpure: n zrgubq inyhr vf n shapgvba inyhr gbb. N pbzcvyr reebe orpbzrf n `Cnefr` reebe jvgu
  gur grez.
- **Fnzcyvat ol erdhrfg.** N yrns gung svaqf gur `erdhrfg_vq=` jbeq, unfurf vgf inyhr jvgu
  `unfu/sai`, naq xrrcf gur yvar jura `unfu % 10000 < engr * 10000`. Ab `eaq`, ab fgngr, naq rirel
  yvar bs n xrcg erdhrfg vf xrcg.
